 OGGER FEATURES: CrimZon Red / The Poetic i2i PRICE: Tickets&nbsp\;are $15 
 and can be purchased online here: LetFreshFireFall.Eventbrite.com &nbsp\; 
 CONTACT: If you're interested in being a vendor\, please call&nbsp\; (646)
  372-6230 &nbsp\;or email&nbsp\; PoetsWithPurpose@gmail.com .&nbsp\;
LOCATION:Cry Out Cave\, 601 Doctor Martin Luther King Junior Boulevard\, N
 ewark\, NJ\, 07102
